# Local Supabase stack for this package. Start it with `npm run db:start -w packages/db`,
# then run `supabase status --workdir packages/db` (or check the start output) for the current
# Project URL and API keys — used by apps/admin and apps/portal for local dev.
#
# Non-default ports (packages/db/supabase/config.toml) to avoid colliding with other local
# Supabase stacks already running on this machine: API 55321, DB 55322, Studio 55323.
